  "label": {
    "en": [
      "Black‑and‑white postcard view of a small town with a prominent stone church and tower rising above surrounding trees and wooden houses. The church tower has a stepped gable and decorative white crosses and a circular motif near the top. At the bottom of the image, printed text reads \"TORSHÄLLA KYRKA.\" The lower foreground is faded or left blank, typical of early picture postcards."
    ]
